<title>UK: S&amp;P cuts Scottish Power short-term rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P cuts Scottish Power short-term rating.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it lowered the short-term rating on Scottish Power Plc to A1 from A1 plus and took it off CreditWatch.</p>
</text>
